x-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
