" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, we can write the integral as\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"211\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 13.874em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-munder><mjx-row><mjx-base style=\"padding-left: 0.088em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-base></mjx-row><mjx-row><mjx-under style=\"padding-top: 0.167em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-under></mjx-row></mjx-munder><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx